# Always run fastlane from this bundle. A bare `fastlane` uses whatever
# version happens to be on PATH, which is how a lane that worked yesterday
# signs differently today — and so does `bundle exec fastlane` when a Homebrew
# fastlane is ahead of this Ruby on PATH. A binstub cannot be shadowed:
# `bundle binstubs fastlane`, then `./bin/fastlane`. `shipway release` does the
# same thing.
